# Activity Monitor namespace manifest (docs/USERSPACE_v2.md UP4).
#
# It reads the UI runtime out of the sealed /system and owns a window, and that
# is the whole of what it needs from the FILESYSTEM -- it never opens a document
# and has no business being able to. Everything it displays comes from syscalls
# about the machine (proc_list, meminfo), which are gated by capability and by
# session, not by what this manifest can name.
#
# Note what is absent: the user's home. A monitor that could read your files
# would be a monitor with a reason to, and there isn't one.
ro /system
